  "UI_WORLDLEVEL_ADJUST_DOWN_AIM_INFO": "Lowered World Level",
  "UI_WORLDLEVEL_ADJUST_DOWN_TIPS": "Once confirmed, your World Level will be decreased by 1.\n· The level of opponents in the open world will <color=#F39000FF>decrease</color>\n· The rewards from Ley Line Blossoms and enemy drops will <color=#F39000FF>decrease</color>\nYou will be unable to readjust your World Level for the next <color=#F39000FF>24</color> hours.",
  "UI_WORLDLEVEL_ADJUST_HINT": "World Level Adjusted To",
  "UI_WORLDLEVEL_ADJUST_HINT_GETEASY_": "Reduce the World Level and the strength of opponents?",
  "UI_WORLDLEVEL_ADJUST_TITLE": "Change World Level",
  "UI_WORLDLEVEL_ADJUST_UP_AIM_INFO": "Reverted World Level",
  "UI_WORLDLEVEL_ADJUST_UP_TIPS": "Once confirmed, your World Level will be reverted to its original form.\n· The level of opponents in the open world will <color=#F39000FF>increase</color> to match your original World Level\n· The rewards from Ley Line Blossoms and enemy drops will <color=#F39000FF>increase</color> to match your original World Level\nYou will be unable to readjust your World Level for the next <color=#F39000FF>24</color> hours.",
  "UI_WORLDLEVEL_DOWN_BUTTON": "Lower World Level",
  "UI_WORLDLEVEL_INFO": "<color=#D3BC8EFF>World Level</color>\nThis represents the level of challenge posed to adventurers by the world.\nYour <color=#FFCC33>World Level will increase</color> along with your Adventure Rank, granting you more bountiful treasures from your adventures and from Ley Line Blossoms. But naturally, the opponents you encounter will also grow stronger...\n\n<color=#D3BC8EFF>World Level and Adventure Rank</color>\nWhen your Adventure Rank reaches <color=#FFCC33>20</color>/<color=#FFCC33>25</color>/<color=#FFCC33>30</color>/<color=#FFCC33>35</color>/<color=#FFCC33>40</color>/<color=#FFCC33>45</color>/<color=#FFCC33>50</color>/<color=#FFCC33>55</color>/<color=#FFCC33>58</color>, your World Level will increase by 1.\nThe maximum Adventure Rank is 60, and the maximum World Level is 9.\nAdditionally, you need to complete <color=#FFCC33>Ascension Quests</color> at Adventure Ranks <color=#FFCC33>25</color>/<color=#FFCC33>35</color>/<color=#FFCC33>45</color>/<color=#FFCC33>50</color>/<color=#FFCC33>58</color> respectively to increase your World Level. Learn more at the Adventurers' Guild.\nWhen your Adventure Rank reaches the maximum, any extra Adventure EXP will be converted to Mora.\n\n<color=#D3BC8EFF>Change World Level</color>\nAfter reaching World Level <color=#FFCC33>3</color>, the option to decrease your World Level will become available. You can decrease your World Level by <color=#FFCC33>1</color>.\nDecreasing your World Level lowers the level of Ley Line Blossoms and opponents in the open world, but also decreases the rewards you gain from defeating them.\nAfter changing your World Level, you cannot change it again for the next 24 hours.\nWhether you wish to restore your World Level after decreasing it or decrease it after restoring it, you must wait 24 hours before you can make the change.",
  "UI_WORLDLEVEL_TITLE": "World Level",
  "UI_WORLDLEVEL_UP_BUTTON": "Revert World Level",
